ome known output)\n3) expand the node preview \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAttached is the project my example screenshot was taken from.  In the example, there is one node that should be displaying a static image and one that should be displaying a dynamic image... neither is working correctly.\n\n[issue-visual-shader-node-preview.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25724670/issue-visual-shader-node-preview.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"pbella","id":1817202,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTcyMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1817202?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella","html_url":"https://github.com/pbella","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117037/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117037/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}